{"version":1,"content":"<p>今年的倫敦初秋，氣溫相對舒適宜人，日間溫度多半達 20 度左右，不少家庭單位及遊客選擇到大形公園消遣，伴着曖陽及涼風野餐、散步、長跑、溜狗等；在不算遠離倫敦市中心的公園內，公園內除了訪客，亦有比園內人類數量還多的「原住民」，牠們是馬鹿（Red Deer）與黇鹿（Fallow Deer）。 攝影、撰文：CKW</p>\n<p></p>\n\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/CKW_8333-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/CKW_8661-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/CKW_8319-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/CKW_9060-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/CKW_8916-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/CKW_9015-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/CKW_9733-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p>不過大家要注意，秋季正屬野鹿的發情季節，牠們會比平常更有攻擊性及侵略性，不時會在公園內聽到鹿鳴，大家亦能從相片中見到雄鹿頭上的角長得十分巨型，園方一般會設置警告牌提醒遊人與鹿群保持最少 50 米距離，而且相比港人較多機會接觸過的日本奈良鹿而言，倫敦的野鹿普遍不會主動靠近人類，更甚者會主動避開，園方亦呼籲遊客不要餵餇野鹿。</p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"768\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/CKW_9261-1024x768.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/CKW_9639-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"768\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/CKW_9664-1024x768.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"768\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/CKW_9576-1024x768.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/CKW_9724-683x1024.jpeg\" width=\"683\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/CKW_9278-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"768\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/CKW_9379-1024x768.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/CKW_8370-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/CKW_8742-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p>以上相片均攝於 2026 年 9 月 22 日</p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"237\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Payme-500x237.png\" width=\"500\"/></figure>","scraped_at":"2026-10-04T15:58:31.659341+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":340,"images":17,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"rss-blocked"}}